OL,3,GNEWSA'Significant' smoke warning from
OL,4,Aheath fire
OL,5,
OL,6,FResidents have been advised to keep
OL,7,Ftheir doors and windows closed due to a
OL,8,Fheath fire creating a "significant
OL,9,Famount of smoke".
OL,11,FDorset and Wiltshire Fire and Rescue
OL,12,FService (DWFRS) said it is currently
OL,13,Fdealing with a fire on Canford Heath
OL,14,Fafter being called at 19:39 GMT.
OL,16,FIt said are 14 firefighting appliances
OL,17,Fin attendance from across the county
OL,18,Fand in Hampshire tackling the fire
OL,19,Finvolving an area of heath about 2.47
OL,20,Facres (10,000 sq m).
OL,23,APub: 04-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
